# Fomalhaut Acquisition Society

id:polity-fomalhaut-acquisition-society a oa:Polity ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fomalhaut Acquisition Society" ;
    oa:ambiguousName false ;
    oa:color "#C77B10" ;
    oa:editorialNote "Pushed off the Non-Coercive Zone twice. Moving it out of red-orange only\ngot it to 13.3, which measures as clear and does not read as clear beside\na polity holding six hundred places; turning it gold and darkening it\ngets 19.3, and picks up Orion Federation, 12.6 away and closer than\nNoCoZo ever was. Still warm — a small polity's colour should not shout." ;
    oa:hasSource src:eg-system-articles ;
    oa:kind "polity" ;
    oa:polityId "fomalhaut-acquisition-society" ;
    oa:recordOrder 26 ;
    oa:uncertain false .
